[
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/elduukhar/default/0",
    "raw": "We should hang out sometime. Get smashed. Eat garflipps. Avoid Kevin.",
    "value": "我们改天应该聚聚。喝个痛快，吃点加布林，避开凯文。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/elduukhar/default/1",
    "raw": "My calculations are infallible. That means we're all going to die soon!",
    "value": "我的计算从不出错。这意味着我们很快都会死掉！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/elduukhar/default/2",
    "raw": "There's rumored to be a place at the edge of known space made ^yellow;entirely^reset; of shrimp.",
    "value": "传闻在已知宇宙的边缘，有一处^yellow;完全^reset;由虾构成的地方。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/elduukhar/default/3",
    "raw": "I wonder...what if we're entirely wrong about everything?",
    "value": "我在想...如果我们对所有事情的看法都完全错了呢？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/slimeperson/default/0",
    "raw": "I'm sorry if my appearance bothers you. That's your problem, not mine.",
    "value": "如果我的外表让你感到不适，那是你的问题，不是我的。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/slimeperson/default/1",
    "raw": "My odour is none of your concern. Nor are the circumstances of my birth, so do not ask.",
    "value": "我的气味与你无关。我的出身亦是如此，所以请勿多问。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/slimeperson/default/2",
    "raw": "Ever had a feeling of Deja Vu?",
    "value": "是否曾有过似曾相识的感觉？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/slimeperson/default/3",
    "raw": "You don't know the hell of remembering a life you never lived, so do not deign to judge my people.",
    "value": "你未曾体会过铭记一段从未经历的人生的煎熬，所以请不要妄加评判我的人民。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/slimeperson/default/4",
    "raw": "Us Slimes need to stick together. We are rare, fractured, and unique.",
    "value": "我们史莱姆必须团结一致。我们稀有、分散，却又独一无二。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/slimeperson/default/5",
    "raw": "I am the first among my people, that I know of, to obtain a doctorate.",
    "value": "据我所知，我是我们种族中第一个获得博士学位的人。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/slimeperson/default/6",
    "raw": "Life for a Slime is one of horrified looks, threatened whispers and being hated for something we cannot help.",
    "value": "史莱姆的生活，充满了惊恐的目光、威胁的低语，以及因无法改变的本性而遭受的憎恨。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/slimeperson/default/7",
    "raw": "This is why I practice science here. I can be safe, and not worry about the prejudices present in the universe.",
    "value": "这就是我在此钻研科学的原因。在这里，我能安心工作，不必担忧宇宙中无处不在的偏见。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/veluu/default/0",
    "raw": "Mrowr. There is a constant source of aggravation that plagues us, and its name is Kevin.",
    "value": "唔姆。总有一个源源不断的烦恼困扰着我们，那就是凯文。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/veluu/default/1",
    "raw": "I can do a backflip. I have it on good authority that you are not able to do so.",
    "value": "我能做后空翻。据可靠消息，你做不到这一点。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/veluu/default/2",
    "raw": "Mmmmrrowr.",
    "value": "唔姆。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/veluu/default/3",
    "raw": "You look like you do not groom yourself enough. I suggest you emulate my people. None are cleaner.",
    "value": "你看起来似乎不太注重个人打理。我建议你效仿我们的人，他们无一不是整洁干净的典范。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/veluu/default/4",
    "raw": "I long for the hunt, but my mind is far more valuable a tool.",
    "value": "我渴望狩猎，但我的头脑才是更为珍贵的利器。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fuizku/default/0",
    "raw": "I honestly had no idea it was possible to coat this entire facility with lip gloss. That was an interesting day.",
    "value": "说实话，我真没想到能把整个设施都涂上唇彩。那天可真是有意思。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fuizku/default/1",
    "raw": "I'd bet 1000 pixels that you can't lick your elbows without dislocating bones.",
    "value": "我敢赌一千像素，你绝对没法在不脱臼的情况下舔到自己的手肘。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fuizku/default/2",
    "raw": "Let us rejoice and dance the dance of joy.",
    "value": "让我们欢欣鼓舞，跳起喜悦之舞。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fuizku/default/3",
    "raw": "Beauty is in the eye of the beholder. My people know this better than most.",
    "value": "美存在于观者眼中。我族对此的理解，比多数人更为深刻。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fuizku/default/4",
    "raw": "What are you staring at? There is science to do!",
    "value": "你在看什么？科学正等着我们去探索！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fuizku/default/5",
    "raw": "There is no reality in which you are smarter than I.",
    "value": "在任何情况下，你都不可能比我更聪明。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fuizku/default/6",
    "raw": "I'd love to skin a ponex and stuff its rotting carcass. Taxidermy is a hobby of mine, and Ponexes are horrifying flesh-devouring monsters.",
    "value": "我倒是很想剥下一只“彩虹马驹”的皮，把它的腐尸做成标本。标本制作是我的爱好，而“彩虹马驹”是那种令人毛骨悚然、吞噬血肉的怪物。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fuizku/default/7",
    "raw": "Dogs are incapable of flight. Who knew? Sorry, Fluffy! *sob*",
    "value": "狗儿不会飞，谁曾想到呢？抱歉了，毛毛！*啜泣*"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fuizku/default/8",
    "raw": "There is no reality in which you are smarter than I.",
    "value": "在任何情况下，你都不可能比我更聪明。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fuanodyne/default/0",
    "raw": "If I see Kevin before lunch, I am going to get Thorlokk to pummel him into pulp.",
    "value": "如果午饭前让我碰到凯文，我就让索洛克把他揍成肉泥。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fuanodyne/default/1",
    "raw": "Watch your step. I hear Kevin has been hiding weird crap all over the station again.",
    "value": "小心脚下。听说凯文又在站点各处藏了些奇怪的东西。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fuanodyne/default/2",
    "raw": "Another day, another dollar. And another annoying prank.",
    "value": "又是一天，又是一块钱。外加一个烦人的恶作剧。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fuanodyne/default/3",
    "raw": "Ever seen a Garflipp? They are weird worms capable of psionic cleansing...something no other known species can accomplish.",
    "value": "见过加布林吗？它们是一种奇特的蠕虫，能够进行心灵净化...这是目前已知其他物种都无法做到的能力。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fuanodyne/default/4",
    "raw": "I am recording all of our social interactions for data. I hope you don't mind.",
    "value": "我正在记录我们所有的社交互动作为数据。希望你不介意。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fuanodyne/default/5",
    "raw": "One of these days this trash can will do something interesting. Today is not that day.",
    "value": "总有一天，这堆垃圾也能做出点有趣的事来。可惜今天还不是时候。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fuanodyne/default/6",
    "raw": "Is it difficult being fleshy? I often wonder what it feels like to chew things, or to excrete waste. These are things I shall never experience.",
    "value": "身为血肉之躯是否艰难？我时常思索，咀嚼食物是何感受，排泄废物又是怎样体验。这些，我永远无法知晓。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/0",
    "raw": "I was to be a sandwich maker, like my father before me. But I chose a lesser path in life: Knowledge. I'll leave the sandwiches to true masters.",
    "value": "我曾注定要成为一名三明治师傅，就像我父亲那样。但我选择了人生中一条较为平凡的道路：求知。至于三明治，就留给真正的大师们去创造吧。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/1",
    "raw": "You aren't one of those people that use...white bread...with their sandwiches, are you? We can't be friends if this is the case.",
    "value": "你该不会是用...白面包做三明治的那种人吧？如果是这样，我们可没法做朋友了。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/2",
    "raw": "<entityname>! <entityname>! <entityname>! <entityname>!",
    "value": "<entityname>! <entityname>! <entityname>! <entityname>!"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/3",
    "raw": "<entityname>, why is it you have such a high body count? Do you just walk around murdering everything?",
    "value": "<entityname>，为何你身上背负如此多的命案？难道你四处游荡，见人就杀吗？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/4",
    "raw": "I'm Kevin. Everyone here hates me. This pleases me.",
    "value": "我是凯文。这里每个人都讨厌我。这让我很满意。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/5",
    "raw": "I lie all the time. By the way, I'm Kevin.",
    "value": "我总在说谎。顺便一提，我是凯文。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/6",
    "raw": "I'm <entityname>,<entityname>. You cannot also be <entityname>. Change your name. I won't.",
    "value": "我是<entityname>,<entityname>。你也肯定不是<entityname>。改个名字吧。我不改。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/7",
    "raw": "There is a universal conspiracy whispered that Mantizi invented bread. If we had invented bread, we would have first had to invent the universe.",
    "value": "坊间流传着一个普遍的阴谋论，说甲虫族发明了面包。倘若真是我们发明了面包，那首先得先发明整个宇宙才行。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/8",
    "raw": "I'm Kevin. I am well loved around here.",
    "value": "我是凯文，在这里很受大家喜爱。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/9",
    "raw": "Life is 27.3% less enjoyable when wearing pants. Prove me wrong.",
    "value": "穿裤子时，生活的乐趣会减少27.3%。不服来辩。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/10",
    "raw": "I could make a career out of sandwich making, but that seems so ....plain.",
    "value": "我本可以靠做三明治谋生，但那似乎太...平淡无奇了。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/11",
    "raw": "I once went without pants for 3 full cycles. This was during my earlier years.",
    "value": "我曾整整三个周期没穿裤子，那是在我年轻的时候。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/12",
    "raw": "There's no easy way to say this...so I won't.",
    "value": "这件事很难启齿...所以我还是不说了。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/13",
    "raw": "You smell exactly like garflipps. Why?",
    "value": "你闻起来简直和加布林一模一样。为什么？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/14",
    "raw": "<entityname>",
    "value": "<entityname>"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/15",
    "raw": "<entityname> is an interesting name. It reminds me of a philosopher of my people, Jeff. He came up with the noble profession of Sandwich Maker.",
    "value": "<entityname>是个有趣的名字。它让我想起了我们民族的一位哲学家，杰夫。他提出了“三明治制作师”这一崇高职业。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/16",
    "raw": "There are three types of people. You're the good kind. Flavor-wise, I mean.",
    "value": "世上有三种人。你是好的那种。我是说，在品味上。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/17",
    "raw": "It smells like mushrooms and everyone looks like they want to kill me. Just like home!",
    "value": "闻起来有蘑菇的味道，而且每个人都像是想杀了我。就像在家一样！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/18",
    "raw": "I can't believe nobody noticed the lip gloss...",
    "value": "真不敢相信居然没人注意到唇彩..."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/19",
    "raw": "I'm debating on the merits of strange matter for my next amazing sculpture. Thoughts? And don't bother with that 'it's going to kill us all' nonsense.",
    "value": "我正在考虑用奇异物质作为我下一件惊艳雕塑的材料，你觉得如何？别拿“它会毁灭全人类”那套废话来烦我。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/20",
    "raw": "I once defeated a Xar in a farting contest. That's really hard to do, given that my people don't have buttcheeks.",
    "value": "我曾在一场放屁比赛中赢过一个夏尔人。这确实很难做到，毕竟我们族人没有屁股瓣。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/21",
    "raw": "There are exactly three stenches that get me excited. Four, now. The fourth is you.",
    "value": "能让我心动的气味，原本只有三种。现在，是四种了。第四种，是你。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/22",
    "raw": "How many waffles can you fit in a single catheter bag?",
    "value": "一个导尿袋里能装多少华夫饼？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/23",
    "raw": "I'd imagine somewhere between zero and thirty.",
    "value": "我猜大概在零到三十之间。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/24",
    "raw": "I guess it would depend on how they were added. Are they solid waffles? Liquified? Have they been garflipped?",
    "value": "我猜这得看它们是怎么被加进去的。是完整的华夫饼吗？还是液化的？有没有经过加布林处理？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/25",
    "raw": "I'm going to uncover this mystery, and the entire universe will thank me for it. Who doesn't love a waffle?",
    "value": "我要揭开这个谜团，整个宇宙都会为此感谢我。谁不爱华夫饼呢？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/26",
    "raw": "I'm absolutely positive that there are medical applications to stabbing.",
    "value": "我完全确信，刺伤在医学上也有其应用价值。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/27",
    "raw": "Look, you have a mod conflict installed. Go to your starbound.log and check. Hah! Made you look. But really, keep an eye on your mods, stupid.",
    "value": "看，你装的模组有冲突。去查查你的starbound.log文件吧。哈！骗到你了。不过说真的，蠢货，多留意你的模组情况。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/28",
    "raw": "Have you ever wondered why you aren't currently dead? I do all the time.",
    "value": "你是否曾想过，为何此刻自己还活着？我时常这样问自己。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/29",
    "raw": "Don't believe the infraction log. That was...a different Kevin. Honest.",
    "value": "别信那个违规记录。那其实是...另一个凯文干的。真的。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/30",
    "raw": "Stop staring at my pecs, <entityname>.",
    "value": "别老盯着我的胸肌看，<entityname>。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/31",
    "raw": "Earth? Never did get a chance to go there. I heard it was pretty nice.",
    "value": "地球？一直没机会去那儿。听说那儿挺不错的。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/32",
    "raw": "That's my cloaca. My eyes are up here. Surely my gender cannot be that important to you.",
    "value": "那是我的泄殖腔。我的眼睛在这儿呢。我的性别对你来说，应该没那么重要吧。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/33",
    "raw": "Nobody loves you. Except for me. Work with me. Why? Dancing velociraptors. Need I say more?",
    "value": "没人爱你。除了我。跟我合作吧。为什么？因为跳舞的迅猛龙。还需要多说吗？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/34",
    "raw": "I like filling briefcases and boxes with super fun things and then selling them. Or giving them away!",
    "value": "我喜欢把超有趣的东西塞满公文包和盒子，然后卖掉它们，或者干脆送人！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/35",
    "raw": "Have you ever been hugged by intestines? Oddly comforting, really.",
    "value": "你曾被肠子拥抱过吗？奇怪的是，竟有种莫名的安心感。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/36",
    "raw": "Unfortunately, you can't hide weapons in a urethra. I've tried. The subjects always get irate.",
    "value": "可惜的是，尿道里藏不了武器。我试过，实验对象总是会暴怒。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/37",
    "raw": "There is no way to alter the gender of a starfish using only a hammer. You win this time, nature.",
    "value": "仅凭一把锤子，是无法改变海星的性别的。这次算你赢了，大自然。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/38",
    "raw": "You look like you want to judge me. But I watched what you did using my infini-cam.",
    "value": "你看起来想评判我。但我用我的无限摄像头看到了你的所作所为。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/39",
    "raw": "I can't believe you killed the *entire* village.",
    "value": "我简直不敢相信你竟然屠杀了*整个*村庄。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/40",
    "raw": "You're a murderer.",
    "value": "你是个虾仁犯。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/41",
    "raw": "I wondered why humans looked uncomfortably when I asked if I could use a nutcracker on them. I later found out that human language has...interesting intricacies",
    "value": "我曾好奇，为何当我问能否用胡桃夹子夹他们时，人类会露出不适的表情。后来才发现，人类的语言里藏着...耐人寻味的微妙之处。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/42",
    "raw": "What? No, I am most certainly *not* an avatar of an Elder God. Why would you insinuate such a thing? I'm not handsome enough.",
    "value": "啥？不，我绝对*不是*某个上古之神的化身。你怎么会暗示这种事？我可不够帅。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/43",
    "raw": "I have quite thoroughly mastered the art of placing smaller things into larger things. Few can surpass me in the art of stacking. It's not a particularly -useful- skill, but there you have it.",
    "value": "我深谙将小物置入大物的技艺，在堆叠之道上鲜有人能及。这虽非什么实用技能，但确实如此。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/44",
    "raw": "I've been watching you for a very long time, <entityname>. You do really strange things in your free time. Really, really strange.",
    "value": "我已经观察你很久了，<entityname>。你在空闲时间做的事情真的很奇怪，非常非常奇怪。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/45",
    "raw": "Meditating in a field of tendrils as you listen to the calming wails of a stillborn planet is the best way to meditate on the nature of the universe. Trust me.",
    "value": "在一片藤蔓丛生的原野中冥想，聆听着一颗死寂行星的宁静哀鸣，这是参悟宇宙本质的最佳方式。相信我。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fumantizi/default/46",
    "raw": "I have convinced one of the staff here that they should sneak into your ship to watch you sleep. For science. I may have implied that you were immortal.",
    "value": "我已经说服这里的一位工作人员，让他们偷偷溜上你的飞船，观察你睡觉。为了科学。我可能暗示过你是不朽的。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fukirhos/default/0",
    "raw": "Recently I purchased a new FTL drive. This sweet baby is going to impress my Arkology so much!",
    "value": "最近我入手了一台新的超光速引擎。这小宝贝绝对会让我的生态建筑惊艳不已！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fukirhos/default/1",
    "raw": "It even has an auto-failsafe in its quantum-state capacitor. The third of its kind! Of course, it isn't strictly ^red;legal^reset; by Protectorate standards...so lets keep that between us.",
    "value": "它甚至在量子态电容器中配备了自动故障保险装置，这可是第三代技术！当然，按照守护团的标准，这并不完全^red;合法^reset;...所以这件事就我们之间知道就好。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fukirhos/default/2",
    "raw": "Might we exchange pleasantries when I am not working? I have to complete this horticultural examination.",
    "value": "在我闲暇时，我们可否寒暄几句？我得先完成这份园艺考试。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fukirhos/default/3",
    "raw": "There is no greater threat to sanity than boredom. Never let your mind be totally idle!",
    "value": "对心智最大的威胁莫过于无聊。永远别让你的大脑完全闲置！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fukirhos/default/4",
    "raw": "Don't invest in Sigma-Tyovis at this point in time. Their market value is a bit too volatile. Futures projections are grim.",
    "value": "目前不宜投资西格玛·泰维斯公司。其市值波动过于剧烈，未来前景亦不容乐观。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fukirhos/default/5",
    "raw": "I'd bet money on just about any wager if the stakes are right. Why, last Tuesday I made 4 million pixels from Kevin. I should probably be more concerned about this than I am.",
    "value": "只要赌注合适，我几乎什么赌都敢下。就说上周二吧，我从凯文那儿赢了四百万像素。按理说我该更在意这事才对。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fukirhos/default/6",
    "raw": "I find it exceptionally difficult to adjust to new gravity fields. I prefer artificial gravity like we have at home on the Novustech Arkology.",
    "value": "我发现适应新的重力场异常困难。我更喜欢像我们在诺瓦斯特克生态城中那样的人造重力环境。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fukirhos/default/7",
    "raw": "Where do you hail from? I don't see many folks like you around here.",
    "value": "你来自哪里？这附近很少见到像你这样的人。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/fukirhos/default/8",
    "raw": "<entityname>! Nice to see you. We should have lunch sometime and discuss your stocks!",
    "value": "<entityname>！很高兴见到你。我们找个时间一起吃午饭，聊聊你的股票吧！"
