    "path": "/scriptConfig/dialog/converse/hylotl/default/1",
    "raw": "Everything you know is wrong. Science has proven this to us time and time again. I sense another breakthrough of this nature is coming soon.",
    "value": "你所知的一切都是错误的。科学已经一次又一次地向我们证明了这一点。我感觉到，另一场类似的突破即将到来。"
